# Render's own exclusion list, separate from .gitignore.
#
# The build succeeds and genuinely produces apps/api/dist, but the deploy still crashed on
# "Cannot find module apps/api/dist/cli/migrate.js" - dist/ is (correctly) gitignored, since
# compiled output has no business being committed, but Render's own build-to-deploy handoff
# reads that same .gitignore to decide what survives into the running instance, and silently
# drops anything it matches, freshly built or not. This file is that same list minus dist/ -
# the one thing here that both belongs out of git and has to reach the running server.

node_modules/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

.env
.env.*
!.env.local

*.md

*.log
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

apps/web/test-results/
apps/web/playwright-report/
apps/web/blob-report/
